{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has vertices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/607b9ee92ed781cff1ebe620c13eb0731e3876da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(-3, -2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/298fa8f19cdf76260a71fc7d033ec7cdaa59ba87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(0, r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a664f4d1c18ae5737873e22c6b57b50307329ab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C(6, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/2/83231c0424437f71821ea7c2841472c6bdc42955.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(s, t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> &lt; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/ccea3ddc58dfdf34d44cc5894530dc645889ed64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s + t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/23823fb8a55d2ae294d84c6146cccf9cb3fbdb37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 12\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the description, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a parallelogram, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9a427387ff6212e24b2c3bf3ce692b2e62d50a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = CD$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/34673b3ff56027229ea2bd2930091325d50cb95c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />. This means that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-distance and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> must be the same as the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-distance and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-distance for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d99c6f95109ba03680bc60e56679d75dbfac10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 - (-3) = 6 - s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55b54242bdcce903992bb1b21835d31632ffbf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 - s = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />, and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76720064e1b87e0398cffaa492648ca5ef307a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/b/28ba5ba25cc91ed63eb3b7d5d390a1b4f9eb9112.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 - r = t - 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bdba349b3b1195401b8fb1e6a3610afb64eeea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + t = -2 + 10 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"161\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd9acf14d25bdca83a43af294b05ad53df33b8b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + t = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76720064e1b87e0398cffaa492648ca5ef307a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce7e09d3949384e268f65987e1a5d7066a9fab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + t + s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b54c18fd79a5d0465d0b72b6e900bb4e56eebbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"131\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Using_Values.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Using_Values)\">Solution 2 (Using Values)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Using Values)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the same reasoning as solution 1, we can conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a parallelogram and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76720064e1b87e0398cffaa492648ca5ef307a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. We can also make the parallelogram \"flat\" by making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f51d816dd09fe7c1a0f9ffdd8ce247910c33c929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, r)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> have the same <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/589828dd64134011913fd04c5e8005b557138fe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3, -2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/8/f98b5f1f3cf9331a3f398911e2a8cd223839672e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(s, t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" /> have the same <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/943115151409f178a0435441def2c3d74850c042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> to make this easier. We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6ba4ef452fa3f3441119f851e0fa3fb94248408d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb9f413d068da131353aae41ef7c1f4caf149d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>Plugging in the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/ccea3ddc58dfdf34d44cc5894530dc645889ed64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r + s + t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/560408d909bbe911b84f3407ce34fc01de634935.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 + 3 + 10 = 1 + 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"259\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems